nalyzer","name":"analyzer","color":"c0f7f6","default":false,"description":"Indicates an issue which is related to analyzer experience","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/353","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestone/353","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/353/labels","id":13180918,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAQzde84AyR_2","number":353,"title":".NET 11 Planning","description":"","creator":{"login":"danroth27","id":1874516,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzQ1MTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1874516?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27","html_url":"https://github.com/danroth27","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":101,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-07-01T21:05:02Z","updated_at":"2026-08-17T07:24:10Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-08-17T07:24:10Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-01-26T15:38:14Z","updated_at":"2026-06-29T11:57:15Z","closed_at":"2026-06-29T11:57:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Summary\n\nAdd a Roslyn analyzer to detect and warn when a `for` loop iterator variable is captured in a lambda expression, `EventCallback`, two-way binding (`@bind`), or other closure context within Razor components. This is a common pitfall that leads to unexpected runtime behavior because all closures reference the same variable, which holds the final value after the loop completes.\n\n### Cases Where the Analyzer SHOULD Warn ⚠️\n\n#### 1. Lambda expressions in event handlers capturing `for` loop variable\n```razor\n@for (var i = 0; i < items.Length; i++)\n{\n    <button @onclick=\"@(() => SelectItem(i))\">Item @i</button>\n}\n```\n\n#### 2. Two-way binding with `@bind` using loop variable as indexer\n```razor\n@for (var i = 0; i < stringArray.Length; i++)\n{\n    <input type=\"text\" @bind=\"stringArray[i]\" />\n}\n```\n\n#### 3. EventCallback parameters with captured loop variable\n```razor\n@for (var i = 0; i < 5; i++)\n{\n    <MyComponent OnClick=\"@(() => HandleClick(i))\" />\n}\n```\n\n#### 4. RenderFragment/ChildContent capturing loop variable\n```razor\n@for (var i = 0; i < 5; i++)\n{\n    <MyComponent>Count: @i</MyComponent>\n}\n```\n\n#### 5. Lambda with event args still capturing loop variable\n```razor\n@for (var i = 1; i < 4; i++)\n{\n    <button @onclick=\"@(e => UpdateHeading(e, i))\">Button #@i</button>\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Cases Where the Analyzer Should NOT Warn ✅\n\n#### 1. Local variable copy within the loop body\n```razor\n@for (var i = 0; i < items.Length; i++)\n{\n    var index = i;\n    <button @onclick=\"@(() => SelectItem(index))\">Item @index</button>\n}\n```\n\n#### 2. Using `foreach` (iteration variable is scoped per iteration in C# 5.0+)\n```razor\n@foreach (var item in items)\n{\n    <button @onclick=\"@(() => SelectItem(item))\">@item.Name</button>\n}\n```\n\n#### 3. Using `foreach` with `Enumerable.Range`\n```razor\n@foreach (var i in Enumerable.Range(0, items.Length))\n{\n    <button @onclick=\"@(() => SelectItem(i))\">Item @i</button>\n}\n```\n\n#### 4. Using `Index()` LINQ method (.NET 9+) for index and value\n```razor\n@foreach (var (index, item) in items.Index())\n{\n    <button @onclick=\"@(() => SelectItem(index))\">@item.Name</button>\n}\n```\n\n#### 5. Using `Select` with index overload\n```razor\n@foreach (var entry in items.Select((item, index) => (item, index)))\n{\n    <button @onclick=\"@(() => SelectItem(entry.index))\">@entry.item.Name</button>\n}\n```\n\n#### 6. Direct method reference (no lambda/closure)\n```razor\n@for (var i = 0; i < items.Length; i++)\n{\n    <button @onclick=\"HandleClick\">Item @i</button>\n}\n```\n\n#### 7. Loop variable used only in non-closure contexts (display only)\n```razor\n@for (var i = 0; i < items.Length; i++)\n{\n    <span>Item @i</span>  // No closure, just rendering\n}\n```","closed_by":{"login":"ilonatommy","id":32700855,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzAwODU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32700855?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy","html_url":"https://github.com/ilonatommy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65234/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65234/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}